# Stagefile build output — regenerated from <name>.stagefile.yaml on every
# build; the lockfile (<name>.stagefile.lock.yaml) is what's committed. The
# glob covers per-variant artifacts too (Dockerfile.generated.prod and its
# paired .dockerignore) alongside the canonical Stagefile's bare name.
Dockerfile.generated
Dockerfile.generated.*
